# The Airbus A320: JSBSim's A320 made to fly to its airport-planning document's
# and type certificate's figures (assets/figures/a320.xml) by tools/make_a320.py.
#
#   name TEXT...                 what it is called
#   model NAME                   its JSBSim model, in data/jsbsim/aircraft
#   start AIRSPEED_KT THROTTLE   a flight begun in the air: its calibrated
#                                airspeed, and the throttle that holds it
#
# Its published figures, if it has them, are data/figures/MODEL.xml, and its
# selftest's log data/selftest/MODEL.log (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).

name Airbus A320
model a320
class airliner
start 250 0.42
# The speedbrake lever works its speedbrakes or spoilers (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).
speedbrakes
# Her main tyres and brakes, for a wet runway's grip (docs/ASSETS.md):
# Airbus A320 Aircraft Characteristics (Jul 2026), 7-2-0: 46x17R20 mains at
# 209 psi, at 77,400 kg (200 at 73,900); the BSCU's anti-skid holds each
# wheel's slip, fully modulating (AAIB report 6/2007 describes it).
brakes 209 fully-modulating
# Her CFM56-5B's pivoting-door thrust reversers (tools/make_a320.py), and
# the reverse brought to idle at 70 kt: Airbus's normal procedure, as the
# TSB's report A05H0002 (1.17.6) gives it - "At 70 knots ... move the thrust
# levers to idle reverse" - and stowed at taxi speed (docs/ASSETS.md).
reversers 70
# Her gear-extended speed, VLE, knots (src/sim/catalogue.hpp): FCOM LIM-AG-SPD, as limitations summaries reproduce it: 280 kt/M.67
# (extension 250, retraction 220).
gear-extended 280
# Her flap limit speeds, VFE, knots indicated, by flap (src/sim/catalogue.hpp):
# EASA's type certificate data sheet for her, EASA.A.064 issue 62 of 26 June
# 2026, section 1 (A320 series), 10, Airspeed Limits, page 45,
# https://www.easa.europa.eu/en/downloads/16507/en (docs/ASSETS.md):
# configuration 1+F, slats 18 and flaps 10, 215 kt; 2, 22/15, 200; 3, 22/20,
# 185; Full, 27/35 (27/40 with IAE or LEAP engines), 177. Configuration 1,
# 18/0, 230 kt, is slats alone, with no flap to limit here. Her model's full
# flap is 40 degrees, and her flaps 25 and 30, which the A320 has no
# configuration for, are held to Full's.
flap-limit 10 215
flap-limit 15 200
flap-limit 20 185
flap-limit 40 177
